// Title: Lace Tempest Malware Loader Execution
// Sigma ID: 745ea50b-9673-4ba7-9426-cb45cf4a8e6d
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-11-09 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects execution of a specific binary based on filename and hash used by Lace Tempest to load
//   additional malware as reported by SysAid Team
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://www.sysaid.com/blog/service-desk/on-premise-software-security-vulnerability-notification
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/Lace-Tempest/proc_creation_win_apt_lace_tempest_loader_execution.yml
